OL,3,GNEWSANursery closure extended six weeks
OL,4,Aby Ofsted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nursery which was closed in July due
OL,7,Fto safeguarding concerns, has had its
OL,8,Fsuspension extended for another six
OL,9,Fweeks.
OL,11,FBright Horizons Nursery, which is based
OL,12,Fat Furness General Hospital in
OL,13,FBarrow-in-Furness, shut on 22 July
OL,14,Fafter the suspension by Ofsted.
OL,16,FA notice from the education watchdog,
OL,17,Fposted on the nursery's door, said it
OL,18,Fhad been shut because there was
OL,19,F"reasonable belief that children may be
OL,20,Fat risk of harm".
OL,23,APub: 15-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
