OL,3,GNEWSANursery closure extended six weeks
OL,4,Aby Ofsted
OL,5,
OL,6,FOfsted has now confirmed the suspension
OL,7,Fwill continue until 24 November. A
OL,8,Fspokesperson for the nursery said they
OL,9,Fwere "sorry for the disruption it has
OL,10,Fcaused" and could not confirm a
OL,11,Freopening date at this stage.
